---
import EpilineCaseLayout from '../../../layouts/EpilineCaseLayout.astro';
const months=[['JAN',302,5.14],['FEB',211,4.84],['MAR',163,4.93],['APR',125,5.03],['MAY',121,5.32],['JUN',91,6.95],['JUL',176,5.19],['AUG',154,6.38]];
---
<EpilineCaseLayout title="Epiline Google Ads case" description="How Google Ads captures existing treatment demand for Epiline." eyebrow="GOOGLE ADS / SEARCH" headline="Capture demand" accent="already there." intro="When someone is already searching for a treatment, the job changes. Google Ads puts Epiline in front of high-intent demand at the moment of choice." metrics={[{value:'1,343',label:'Google Ads conversions · Jan–Aug 2026'},{value:'$5.35',label:'weighted average CPA'},{value:'302',label:'conversions in January'},{value:'8 mo.',label:'period shown'}]}>
<section class="case-section shell"><div class="two"><span class="eyebrow">THE ROLE OF SEARCH</span><div><h2>Intent before interruption.</h2><p class="statement">Meta can create interest. Search captures people who are already looking.</p><p>For Epiline, Google Ads sits alongside Meta rather than replacing it. The channels solve different parts of the acquisition problem: one develops demand, the other captures active intent around treatments and services.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="case-section accent"><div class="shell"><span class="eyebrow">JAN → AUG 2026</span><h2>Search performance<br/>month by month.</h2><div class="bars">{months.map(([m,l])=><div class="bar"><i style={`height:${Number(l)/302*100}%`}></i><b>{l}</b><span>{m}</span></div>)}</div><div class="data-list">{months.map(([m,l,c])=><div class="data-row"><span>{m} 2026</span><span>{l} conversions</span><strong>${Number(c).toFixed(2)} CPA</strong></div>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="case-section dark"><div class="shell two"><span class="eyebrow">THE RESULT</span><div><h2>A second engine<br/>for acquisition.</h2><p>Across January–August 2026, Google Ads generated 1,343 tracked conversions. That means Epiline is not dependent on paid social alone: search provides a separate stream built around existing patient intent.</p><p class="statement">1,343 conversions at approximately $5.35 weighted average CPA.</p></div></div></section>
</EpilineCaseLayout>